	(text_box "1) Combined middle and bottom resistance:\nR_COMBINED = R_TOP / (UV_FALLING - 1.00)\n\n2) Bottom grounding resistor:\nR_BOT = (R_COMBINED + R_TOP) / OV_RISING\n\n3) Middle bridge resistor:\nR_MID = R_COMBINED - R_BOT\n\nSOLAR LINE WINDOW CALCULATIONS (CHANNEL 1)\n============================\nTarget Configuration:\n- Low-Voltage Cutoff (UVLO Falling): 10.0V\n- High-Voltage Cutoff (OVLO Rising): 21.0V\n- LTC4417 internal threshold reference: 1.00V\n- HYS Pin tied to Ground (Fixed 3% Hysteresis Mode)\n\n\nBATTERY LINE WINDOW CALCULATIONS (CHANNEL 2)\n=============================\nTarget Configuration (2S Li-Ion Pack):\n- Low-Voltage Cutoff (UVLO Falling): 6.0V\n- High-Voltage Cutoff (OVLO Rising): 8.6V\n\n+3.3V BUS SUPERVISOR WINDOW CALCULATIONS (CHANNEL 3)\n=========================\nTarget Configuration (Regulated Bus Health Check):\n- Low-Voltage Threshold (UV Falling): 3.0V\n- High-Voltage Threshold (OV Rising): 3.6V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 190.5 0)
		(size 54.61 68.58)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 158 218 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d04e5c14-802b-4d1f-afb2-a191e4a53eeb")
	)
